# Brief cache and downloaded datasets (services/api). Keyed by address hash; never commit it.
# Each region's curated data under data/regions/<id>/ (tariff table, operator overrides, scenario
# constants, and the step-4 indexes: what SAM 3.1 measured per area, what Voice Transcribe heard
# per meeting) is source, not cache, as is the shared data/equivalences.json. Imagery tiles and
# recordings are not.
data/*
!data/equivalences.json
!data/regions/
data/regions/*/perception/*
!data/regions/*/perception/*.json
data/regions/*/hearings/audio/
# Eval runs: briefs for real addresses and their scores.
eval/runs/
# Browser-tool scratch
.playwright-mcp/
